<title>PHILIPPINES: Primetown plans 14 bln-peso building.</title>
<headline>Primetown plans 14 bln-peso building.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primetown Property Group Inc said on Monday it is earmarking 14 billion pesos to put a 42-storey building in the Fort Bonifacio area in the financial district of Makati.</p>
<p>It dubbed its project as a &quot;green tower&quot; because it will be designed in such a way to capture the charm of nature, the company said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
